Level filter option for exact level, everything above, or everything below (#refine)

Add task level tag filtering support (e.g. `#level(1)`, `#level(2)`, `#l1`, `#l2`) with options to filter reminders by:
1. **Exact level**: Show reminders at the exact level (e.g. level 2 only).
2. **Above level (>=)**: Show reminders at the selected level and everything above it (e.g. level 2 and higher priority/depth).
3. **Below level (<=)**: Show reminders at the selected level and everything below it (e.g. level 2 and lower priority/depth).

